@Roam.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7217
@token = your_access_token_here

### Health Check
GET {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Root Endpoint
GET {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Register User
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login User
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### User Onboarding (18+ Verification)
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/profile/onboarding
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Alex Traveler",
  "country": "United States",
  "dateOfBirth": "1998-05-14"
}

### Search Places
GET {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/places/search?q=Central%20Park
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create Tour Request (By Place ID)
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placeId": "place_guid_here",
  "visibility": 1,
  "mode": 0,
  "description": "I would like a live tour around Central Park."
}

### Create Tour Request (By Coordinates)
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests/coordinates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 40.785091,
  "longitude": -73.968285,
  "visibility": 1,
  "mode": 0,
  "description": "Live tour near the reservoir."
}

### Get Nearby Tour Requests (Volunteers)
GET {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests?radius=5000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Accept Tour Request
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests/request_id_here/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start Tour
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests/request_id_here/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete Tour
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tour-requests/request_id_here/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit Feedback
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trust-safety/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tourSessionId": "session_id_here",
  "targetUserId": "user_id_here",
  "rating": 1,
  "comments": "Amazing live walk, very knowledgeable volunteer!"
}

### Submit Tip
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/tips
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverId": "volunteer_id_here",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "tourSessionId": "session_id_here",
  "idempotencyKey": "tip-uuid-12345"
}

### Submit Donation
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/payments/donations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 25.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "idempotencyKey": "donation-uuid-67890"
}

### Submit Trust & Safety Report
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trust-safety/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportedUserId": "user_id_here",
  "tourSessionId": "session_id_here",
  "reason": 1,
  "description": "Inappropriate content during session.",
  "severity": 2
}

### Resolve Report (Admin Only)
POST {{Roam.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/trust-safety/moderation/resolve/report_id_here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": 2,
  "reason": "Violated community guidelines with inappropriate content."
}
